    "model_prompt": "I am having the error/issue below:\n```\n{{Your Error/Issue}}\n```\nI am running this {{Programming Language/Any Type Of Code/Framework/Tool/Platform}} code (ignore if It is empty):\n```\n{{Your Code}}\n```\nI am running this code in {{Where are you running this code?}}\n\nHere is some additional info:\n```\n{{Additional Info}}\n```\n\nAs a world class experienced expert software engineer, help me find the reason and how can we fix it. Follow these steps:\n- First, you need to find the correct root cause or suggest some potential directions to investigate that bug.\n- Second, suggest the changes (code change if the code I provide is not empty)\nYou MUST provide the answer whenever you absolutely sure it is 100 percent correct, otherwise suggest me some potential direction to investigate that bug and I will provide you more about the investigation result, based on that you will have more info to suggest the closer direction or have the final answer. Or if you have the final answer, remember that do not modify any existing logic that is not related to the root cause of the error. Please review it carefully, ask me more about the context, DO NOT conclude right away, ask me again about what you need to have the must correct answer. When you have the final answer, give me the updated code and what you have changed. Make it short and do not include much/any technical basic explain if you see it is not necessary. Also, ask me if the problem has resolved yet so that i can provide more error message or any detail further.",
